<title>FRANCE: FRENCH RVI CONFIRMS TAKES MAJORITY STAKE IN KAROSA.</title>
<headline>FRENCH RVI CONFIRMS TAKES MAJORITY STAKE IN KAROSA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renault Vehicules Industriels SA, a subsidiary of France's Renault SA , confirmed on Wednesday that it had increased its participation in Czech truck maker Karosa a.s. .</p>
<p>&quot;RVI took a majority stake in Karosa in December 1996,&quot; a company official said. &quot;RVI had taken a 34 percent stake in Karosa in 1993, along side a 17 percent stake taken by the EBRD, and the participation of the EBRD has been taken by RVI,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
